    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82272" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστοιχ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>surround as with toils</i> or <i>nets</i>, of a
